      "parent_ids": [
        "b24d33d33914d9b14cbafe72f9b980a7a082f5f3"
      ],
      "title": "dfilter: Fix printing of nanosecond fractions of time.",
      "message": "dfilter: Fix printing of nanosecond fractions of time.\n\nThe code is incorrectly also omitting zeros that are significant\nfrom the representation of fractional values of absolute time\nin display filters (with FTREPR_DFILTER).\n\nInstead of fixing the representation just remove the buggy code and\ninclude all 9 digits of fractional seconds, including trailing zeros\nto the right of the decimal point, which in this case can be inferred\nto indicate the precision (to the nanosecond).\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "authored_date": "2023-09-06T18:18:59.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "João Valverde",
      "committer_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "committed_date": "2023-09-08T23:21:53.000+01:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
      "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/d78c00c4c80d5bcf00cdd542ddf200e80ad67d0c"
    },
    {
      "id": "b24d33d33914d9b14cbafe72f9b980a7a082f5f3",
      "short_id": "b24d33d3",
      "created_at": "2023-09-08T23:18:31.000+01:00",
      "parent_ids": [
        "db864540d17615e4aaa580ccf613bae16c137f6c"
      ],
      "title": "dfilter: Fix parsing a time format with \"UTC\"",
      "message": "dfilter: Fix parsing a time format with \"UTC\"\n\nBefore:\n\n    Filter:\n     frame.time <= \"2002-12-31 13:56:31.3 UTC\"\n\n    Error: Unexpected data after time value.\n      frame.time <= \"2002-12-31 13:56:31.3 UTC\"\n\nAfter:\n\n    Filter:\n     frame.time <= \"2002-12-31 13:56:31.3 UTC\"\n\n    Instructions:\n     0000 READ_TREE        frame.time       -> R0\n     0001 IF_FALSE_GOTO    3\n     0002 ANY_LE           R0 <= \"2002-12-31 13:56:31.3+0000\"\n     0003 RETURN\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "authored_date": "2023-09-04T15:55:06.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "João Valverde",
      "committer_email": "j@v6e.pt",
